     "scopeNote": "A serving relationship describes how the services or interfaces offered by a behavior or active structure element serve entities in their environment. This relationship is applied to both the behavior aspect and the active structure aspect.\n The “Payment Interface” serves the “Customer”, while the “Payment Service” serves the “Pay Invoices” process of that customer.",
